---
// Section 9 (v4) — surface-3. Cosmology section.
// Diff vs v3 (quieter): closing paragraph reduced to a single accent ("humanas"
// urucum). Drops "natureza" verde and italic "Vale do Silício" — the logo
// already carries the three-color cosmology, so the prose can be quieter.
---

<section class="surface-3 section-pad" aria-labelledby="arandu-title">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <h2 id="arandu-title" class="display-xl reveal" style="line-height: 1.0; letter-spacing: -0.025em;">
      <span class="accent-azul">I</span><span class="accent-urucum">a</span><span class="accent-verde">randu</span><span style="color: var(--ink-soft);">.</span>
    </h2>

    <div
      class="reveal mt-[56px] md:mt-[80px] grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto_1fr] gap-[16px] md:gap-[40px] items-start"
      style="transition-delay: 600ms;"
    >
      <div>
        <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--linha-papel); margin-bottom: 20px;" />
        <p class="font-display" style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 48px); color: var(--azul-ceu); line-height: 1;">
          Ia
        </p>
        <p class="mt-[14px] body-sm" style="letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft);">
          inteligência artificial
        </p>
      </div>

      <div
        class="font-display"
        aria-hidden="true"
        style="font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 36px); font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1; padding-top: 28px;"
      >
        +
      </div>

      <div>
        <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--linha-papel); margin-bottom: 20px;" />
        <p class="font-display" style="font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 48px); color: var(--verde-folha); line-height: 1;">
          arandu
        </p>
        <p class="mt-[14px] body-sm" style="letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-soft);">
          sabedoria, em tupi-guarani
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-[64px] md:mt-[96px] measure-tight" style="transition-delay: 800ms;">
      <p class="body-lg" style="text-wrap: pretty;">
        Tecnologia, para nós, tem origem nas necessidades <span class="accent-urucum">humanas</span> e se desenvolve como a natureza.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-[20px] md:mt-[24px] body" style="color: var(--ink-soft); text-wrap: pretty;">
        É muito mais do que um pacote do Vale do Silício.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
